<title>CANADA: TransCanada to buy Enron NGL business.</title>
<headline>TransCanada to buy Enron NGL business.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>TransCanada PipeLines Ltd said on Thursday it entered into a deal to buy Enron Louisiana Energy Co, a unit of Enron Corp, for US$150 million.</p>
<p>TransCanada said the purchase, expected to close at the end of January, would place it among North America's top three natural gas liquids producers with production of 152,000 barrels a day.</p>
</text>
